<title>USA: MSC Industrial says to sell 1.55 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>MSC Industrial says to sell 1.55 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>PLAINVIEW, N.Y. 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>MSC Industrial Direct Co Inc said on Thursday that it had filed a proposed public offering of 1.55 million shares of its class A common stock.</p>
<p>The offering, to be underwritten by Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities Corp and Prudential Securities Inc, was filed with the Security and Exchange Committee, the company said in a statement, but has not yet taken effect.</p>
<p>All of the shares registered will be offered by certain selling shareholders, it added.</p>
<p>MSC Industrial Direct Co Inc is a direct marketer of industrial products.</p>
